<title>UK: Brent dates kept by BP and J.P. Morgan. [CORRECTED 16:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Brent dates kept by BP and J.P. Morgan. [CORRECTED 16:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects the headline and the text to make clear that the dates were kept by J.P Morgan and not Shell.)</p>
<p>The two Brent dates nominated into the forward paper chains were kept by BP and J.P. Morgan, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes load on Oct 11-13. BP now holds four Brent cargoes.</p>
<p>Dated Brent firmed to November +12 cents after a cargo loading Oct 5-7 moved at that level.</p>
<p>-- Kate Dourian, London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
</text>
